      <content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;Early in the morning, Samuel and I went to Devil’s Lake to see the fall foliage and celebrate our birthdays. Devil’s Lake is a state park in Wisconsin. When we came the last time, it wasn’t this crowded, but today there were so many visitors. No surprise, though, the scenery was absolutely stunning.&lt;/p&gt;
